@startuml
title USLP08 - System Sequence Diagram (SSD)

actor "Traffic Manager" as TM
boundary "Railway System" as System

TM -> System: Request route planning for pending freights
System --> TM: Display list of pending freights

TM -> System: Confirm route planning
System -> System: Determine feasible paths for each freight
System --> TM: Present planned routes\n(origin, destination, path,\nload/unload operations)

TM -> System: Review planned routes
System --> TM: Routes confirmed / marked as not plannable

@enduml
